  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u365f816a\" id=\"u365f816a\"><span data-lake-id=\"uca3fc840\" id=\"uca3fc840\">所有错误及警告文档：</span><card type=\"inline\" name=\"bookmarkInline\" value=\"data:%7B%22mode%22%3A%22title%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdeveloper.arm.com%2Fdocumentation%2F101655%2F0961%2FBL51-User-s-Guide%2FError-Messages%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdeveloper.arm.com%2Fdocumentation%2F101655%2F0961%2FBL51-User-s-Guide%2FError-Messages%22%2C%22detail%22%3A%7B%22icon%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdeveloper.arm.com%2Fshared%2Fcommon%2Fimg%2Ffavicon%2Ffavicon.ico%3Fv%3D2.43.2.0%22%2C%22title%22%3A%22Documentation%20%E2%80%93%20Arm%20Developer%22%2C%22belong%22%3Anull%2C%22belong_url%22%3Anull%2C%22desc%22%3Anull%2C%22url%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fdeveloper.arm.com%2Fdocumentation%2F101655%2F0961%2FBL51-User-s-Guide%2FError-Messages%22%2C%22_serializer%22%3A%22web.editor_link_detail%22%7D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LUVLQ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u3023f63b\" id=\"u3023f63b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u52ed6c8f\" id=\"u52ed6c8f\">优先在arm官网搜索官方回答：</span><a href=\"https://developer.arm.com/documentation/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u6bb795af\" id=\"u6bb795af\"><span data-lake-id=\"u50e29b25\" id=\"u50e29b25\">https://developer.arm.com/documentation/</span></a></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"yM8yi\" id=\"yM8yi\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4bf432e5\" id=\"u4bf432e5\">错误ERROR</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"px8Md\" id=\"px8Md\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud74636e7\" id=\"ud74636e7\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">undefined identifier</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22main.c(23)%3A%20error%20C202%3A%20'GPIO_InitTypeDef'%3A%20undefined%20identifier%5Cnmain.c(23)%3A%20error%20C141%3A%20syntax%20error%20near%20'GPIO_InitStructure'%2C%20expected%20'%3B'%5Cnmain.c(28)%3A%20error%20C202%3A%20'GPIO_P3'%3A%20undefined%20identifier%5Cnmain.c(33)%3A%20error%20C202%3A%20'GPIO_P5'%3A%20undefined%20identifier%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KFz7t%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u1590cf1d\" id=\"u1590cf1d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub08dbae8\" id=\"ub08dbae8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">解决：</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf693d8d6\" id=\"uf693d8d6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\"> 检查是否引入头文件：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5a8af80d\" id=\"u5a8af80d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua8cb3788\" id=\"ua8cb3788\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(243, 244, 244)\">GPIO.h</span></code></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"ylZkl\" id=\"ylZkl\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6284e863\" id=\"u6284e863\">ERROR L104: MULTIPLE PUBLIC DEFINITIONS</span></h3><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22***%20ERROR%20L104%3A%20MULTIPLE%20PUBLIC%20DEFINITIONS%5Cn%20%20%20%20SYMBOL%3A%20%20UART_CONFIG%5Cn%20%20%20%20MODULE%3A%20%20.%5C%5CObjects%5C%5CBuzzer.obj%20(BUZZER)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Pdmk8%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u0b851320\" id=\"u0b851320\"><span data-lake-id=\"u615d23c2\" id=\"u615d23c2\">重复定义的公共函数或变量，全局搜索提示给的</span><code data-lake-id=\"u4da11db8\" id=\"u4da11db8\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf17ddbaf\" id=\"uf17ddbaf\">UART_CONFIG</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf1e8761f\" id=\"uf1e8761f\">，看哪里重复了，改个名字，或加个</span><code data-lake-id=\"u1bce473f\" id=\"u1bce473f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud9dc6ebe\" id=\"ud9dc6ebe\">static</span></code></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"Dt97W\" id=\"Dt97W\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1258c82b\" id=\"u1258c82b\">error C267: 'Motors_around': requires ANSI-style prototype</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ua0ff1131\" id=\"ua0ff1131\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1714123967552-97cce385-9894-4f4c-9870-2e03ddfb31c9.png%3Fx-oss-process%3Dimage%252Fwatermark%252Ctype_d3F5LW1pY3JvaGVp%252Csize_20%252Ctext_6buR6ams56iL5bqP5ZGY%252Ccolor_FFFFFF%252Cshadow_50%252Ct_80%252Cg_se%252Cx_10%252Cy_10%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u4f44e8db-3044-44ee-85ca-b32fab7b2eb%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u25618ba3-4d1a-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A650.9090768010166%2C%22height%22%3A144%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A13544%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A716%2C%22originHeight%22%3A158%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.100000023841858%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22APPAPPBLUETOOTHC(67)%3AWAXNINGC206%3AMOTORSAROUND'%3ANISSINGFUNCTION-PROTOTYPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A0%2C%22y%22%3A38%2C%22width%22%3A661%2C%22height%22%3A10%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22APPAPPBLUETOOTH.C(67)%3AERRORC267MOTORSAROUND!%3AREQUIRESANSL-STYLEPROTOTYPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A0%2C%22y%22%3A53%2C%22width%22%3A665%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3Anull%2C%22y%22%3A0%2C%22width%22%3Anull%2C%22height%22%3A81%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMPI1INGMAIN.C...%22%2C%22x%22%3A0%2C%22y%22%3A4%2C%22width%22%3A165%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMPILINGAPPBLUETOOTH%2CC.%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A1%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A299%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMPI1IMGUARTLSRC.%22%2C%22x%22%3A4%2C%22y%22%3A116%2C%22width%22%3A170%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMPI1INGNVICC%22%2C%22x%22%3A3%2C%22y%22%3A100%2C%22width%22%3A142%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22COMPILINGGPIOC%2C%22%2C%22x%22%3A2%2C%22y%22%3A84%2C%22width%22%3A142%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OMMIIINNNTRN%22%2C%22x%22%3A11%2C%22y%22%3A130%2C%22width%22%3A137%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f5f3%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ubcb6fcb8%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u40bd949a\" id=\"u40bd949a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucbdcc7ff\" id=\"ucbdcc7ff\">函数</span><code data-lake-id=\"uc23d2fc3\" id=\"uc23d2fc3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u71c26019\" id=\"u71c26019\">Motors_around</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u29902254\" id=\"u29902254\">所属的头文件没include引用进来, 或者函数名字参数写错了</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua47f615e\" id=\"ua47f615e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u22f3aa9a\" id=\"u22f3aa9a\">​</span><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"wUaQG\" id=\"wUaQG\"><span data-lake-id=\"u72be89be\" id=\"u72be89be\">ERROR L107: ADDRESS SPACE OVERFLOW</span></h2><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22***%20ERROR%20L107%3A%20ADDRESS%20SPACE%20OVERFLOW%5Cn%20%20%20%20SPACE%3A%20%20%20DATA%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20SEGMENT%3A%20%3FDT%3F_PCF8563_ENABLE_TIMER%3FPCF8563%5Cn%20%20%20%20LENGTH%3A%20%200002H%5Cn***%20ERROR%20L107%3A%20ADDRESS%20SPACE%20OVERFLOW%5Cn%20%20%20%20SPACE%3A%20%20%20DATA%20%20%20%20%5Cn%20%20%20%20SEGMENT%3A%20%3FDT%3FEXTI_ISR%5Cn%20%20%20%20LENGTH%3A%20%200001H%5Cn***%20ERROR%20L105%3A%20PUBLIC%20REFERS%20TO%20IGNORED%20SEGMENT%5Cn%20%20%20%20SYMBOL%3A%20%20%3FPCF8563_SET_ALARM%3FBYTE%5Cn%20%20%20%20SEGMENT%3A%20%3FDT%3FPCF8563_SET_ALARM%3FPCF8563%5Cn***%20ERROR%20L105%3A%20PUBLIC%20REFERS%20TO%20IGNORED%20SEGMENT%5Cn%20%20%20%20SYMBOL%3A%20%20WAKEUPSOURCE%5Cn%20%20%20%20SEGMENT%3A%20%3FDT%3FEXTI_ISR%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22One%20Dark%20Pro%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22oSpWs%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u69f1bc78\" id=\"u69f1bc78\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc04a4b00\" id=\"uc04a4b00\">内存空间不够用了，默认使用内存 128 字节。地方</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub0efeafa\" id=\"ub0efeafa\"><br></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"FZx0x\" id=\"FZx0x\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaa15c279\" id=\"uaa15c279\">警告WARNING</span></h2><h3 data-lake-id=\"Fz8di\" id=\"Fz8di\"><span data-lake-id=\"udc5cd40e\" id=\"udc5cd40e\">WARNING L1: UNRESOLVED EXTERNAL SYMBOL</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ufb694999\" id=\"ufb694999\"><span data-lake-id=\"u89b4e61b\" id=\"u89b4e61b\">未解决的外部符号</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"RlPo0\" id=\"RlPo0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5607098a\" id=\"u5607098a\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">WARNING L2: REFERENCE MADE TO UNRESOLVED EXTERNAL</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ufd0bba92\" id=\"ufd0bba92\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaf5fb02d\" id=\"uaf5fb02d\" style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51)\">引用导致未解决的外部符号</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22***%20WARNING%20L1%3A%20UNRESOLVED%20EXTERNAL%20SYMBOL%